cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Reasoning distillation for multiple-choice question answering in Portuguese
  health professions examinations: code, data and analysis
message: >-
  If you use this software or dataset, please cite this record. The accompanying
  manuscript is under review and not yet published; this file will be updated
  with the article reference once it appears.
