repository-code: 'https://github.com/martinellitiago/cot-distillation-health-qa'
abstract: >-
  Code, released dataset and analysis for a study of what actually transfers in
  reasoning distillation. A cross-question derangement control separates the
  causal contribution of a rationale's content from its length and format, and a
  ten-seed paired design separates real technique differences from lucky runs.
  A 32B teacher is distilled into a 4B student on 4,260 Portuguese multiple-choice
  questions from Brazilian health professions examinations (2024-2025).
keywords:
  - reasoning distillation
  - chain-of-thought
  - knowledge distillation
  - small language models
  - health informatics
  - medical question answering
  - multilingual NLP
  - causal ablation
  - reproducibility
